            "heading": "Irish Walking Tour",
            "paragraphs": [
                "This engaging & friendly tour will meet outside The Tankard pub, Kennington Rd., strolling through the streets of south London looking at London Irish history, finishing at the eventful Kennington Park. We will see very varied architecture, from shiny modern high rise buildings to wonderful early Georgian Squares & lots in betweeen. The tour takes approximately 2 hours."
